  "interpretation": [
    "All 165 fresh native worlds complete after the 223-control safety gate. Full independent replay verifies 19,965 controller decisions and 99,825 native samples. Matching and repeated-action dispersion pass, with native/GPU joint armature and passive damping bound to the declared model.",
    "The original 70 percent ordering requirement passes on seed 6119 (66/87, 75.86 percent) and corner 000 (62/87, 71.26 percent), but fails on seed 14172 (44/66, 66.67 percent). All bodies are required, so the prospective ordering screen remains failed.",
    "The predicted best action matches the best measured mean in all nine groups. The conservative selected gain against unchanged action is positive in all nine, but only eight gains exceed the fixed .0001 rad/s tie margin. The initial seed-14172 group has zero distinguishable pairs. These are exposed selected-action leads, not a replacement pass criterion.",
    "Maximum selected regret is 1.073e-6 rad/s across the population, within the unchanged .01 limit; maximum measured repeat spread is 1.956e-6 rad/s, within the 1e-5 bound. The partial ordering failure is not caused by failing selected-regret or repeat-dispersion limits.",
    "Every action was prospectively assigned to its own fresh world; this probe never applies a predictor-selected sequence. None of the short diagnostic worlds recovers or acquires upright dwell, and none violates a joint limit. Long-horizon recovery, closed-loop benefit, learning and product adoption remain unobserved.",
    "The next distinct question is whether the selected-action lead helps actual recovery trajectories across many bodies and settings. A declared discovery successor may test that hypothesis with fresh controls; it cannot reinterpret or erase the failed v3 ordering screen."
  ],
  "next_gate": "Declare a distinct bounded broad multi-body closed-loop recovery-discovery campaign using the corrected predictor as an exposed experimental lead, with fresh original-controller and unchanged-action controls and factored action/trajectory settings. Preserve the v3 all-body ordering failure and its unchanged criterion; nine best-mean-action matches do not qualify the predictor or authorize product adoption. Freeze the selected-action policy, command/joint guards, telemetry, recovery and withdrawal outcomes, body/condition population and budget before worlds. Prove the production route and complete applicable safety gate from a clean pushed freeze, then search broadly, retain every body and failure, and send only useful diverse native leads to fresh full-capture confirmation. Do not repeat the unchanged predictor grid solely to chase pairwise ordering.",
